On first run:

sicca_data/sicca.db is created (SQLite).

An admin user is seeded from the environment variables above.

A persistent secret.key is written under sicca_data/.

Directories for logs, uploads, exports and models are created.

Environment variables
Var	Default	Purpose
SICCA_BASE_DIR	sicca_data	Data root
SICCA_HOST	127.0.0.1	Bind address
SICCA_PORT	5000	Bind port
SICCA_DEBUG	0	Never enable in production
SICCA_SECRET_KEY	persisted file	Flask session secret
SICCA_ADMIN_USER	admin	Seeded on first run
SICCA_ADMIN_PASS	random	Seeded on first run
